[2018-09-06T17:36:45Z | mv-bp | comment]
Potentially is this the issue in the SDK??

typedef uint_fast32_t tickcounter_ms_t;
typedef unsigned int       uint_fast32_t;
if (tickcounter_get_current_ms(connection->tick_counter, &current_ms) != 0)

32 bit MAX
0x FFFFFFFF = 4294967295
4294967295 milliseconds = 4294967 seconds = 1193 hours = 49 days (approx.)

Thus causing an overflow to happen which messes up the connection logic time related deadlines throwing things out of gear??

https://github.com/Azure/azure-uamqp-c/blob/c7770c1a45a62d451353398e281fb5a661cc655c/src/connection.c#L1755

