@massand 
Are you saying that SAS tokens are used even when we use x509 certificate for authentication in C SDK? Our understanding is that SAS tokens aren't used when we use x509 for authentication which is stated in the following document.

https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/iot-hub/iot-hub-devguide-security

A device may either use an X.509 certificate or a security token for authentication, but not both.

