@ma2teo - thanks for reporting the issue. 

> the xio_retrieveoptions->tlsio_mbedtls_retrieveoptions function don’t retrieved the SU_OPTION_X509_CERT and SU_OPTION_X509_PRIVATE_KEY client options, so they aren’t saved.

