One possible cause for this could be `org.eclipse.hono.service.amqp.RequestResponseEndpoint.onLinkAttach(ProtonConnection, ProtonSender, ResourceIdentifier)`. It does register with the event bus and unregisters when the link is closed:

~~~java
final MessageConsumer<JsonObject> replyConsumer = vertx.eventBus().consumer(replyToAddress.toString(), message -> {
…
