This is basically the reason why you have 3 battery sensors :-)
The right way of doing is just `SensorBattery battery(99);` and then in before:
```
battery.setMinVoltage(1.8);
battery.setMaxVoltage(3.0);
```
Otherwise it is like you create three different battery sensors with three different names.
