This is not a duplicate but an "escalation" of this issue, since that issue was RESET resolvable, but mine isn't (and it was back when 0.0.2 was used)  https://github.com/spark/firmware/issues/687

The device got stuck in SETUP mode, and a RESET push just put it into short breathing white and then SETUP again. Only unplugging the LiPo helped, but nothing else was required (no SIM wiggling, no antenna action, just repower).

I'm running this on an Electron G2 v0.5.1 (sorry can't really cut it down to test, since the error is very sporadic, so finding a failing minimal sketch would take ages ;-) )

