Neither `BLE.setAdvertisingInterval()` nor setting the interval via `BLE.setAdvertisingParams()` seem to have any effect despite reporting success (return value `0`).

### Expected Behavior

When seeting the interval scanning devices should also see the updated advertising interval.

### Observed Behavior

